{"title":"Career Roadmap: Store Manager","role":"Store Manager","summary":"Career-entry note: A graduate will usually begin as a Retail Executive, Sales Executive, Store Executive, Management Trainee or Assistant Store Manager and progress to Store Manager after gaining relevant retail experience. A Store Manager role is generally not an immediate graduate position.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA - Retail Management"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in retail operations, sales, inventory, merchandising, customer experience, staff management and store profitability"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Store Manager is responsible for the overall performance of a retail outlet. The role combines sales, operations, inventory, people management, customer experience and financial control."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Store operations"},{"text":"Sales target achievement"},{"text":"Staff management"},{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Visual merchandising"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Billing/POS operations"},{"text":"Stock replenishment"},{"text":"Loss prevention"},{"text":"Store profitability"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Workforce scheduling"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Store reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest skill combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Retail","Sales","Operations","Inventory","People Management","Analytics","Customer Experience"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & retail foundation"},{"text":"Management, accounting, economics, consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Retail case study"},{"text":"Weak business fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Store & sales operations"},{"text":"Retail management, merchandising, inventory"},{"text":"Store-operations project"},{"text":"Only theoretical knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"People & performance management"},{"text":"Workforce planning, analytics, loss prevention"},{"text":"Retail dashboard"},{"text":"No customer-facing exposure"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Store leadership"},{"text":"Retail strategy, profitability, internship"},{"text":"Store-management capstone + internship"},{"text":"Expecting Store Manager role immediately after UG"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Introduction to Retail"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Customer service basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing Management"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"Retail Business Models"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail Management"},{"text":"Store Operations"},{"text":"Sales Management"},{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Retail Merchandising"},{"text":"Customer Relationship Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail Supply Chain"},{"text":"Pricing & Promotion"},{"text":"Visual Merchandising"},{"text":"Retail Technology"},{"text":"POS systems"},{"text":"Workforce Management"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail Strategy"},{"text":"Category Management"},{"text":"Retail Analytics"},{"text":"Store Profitability"},{"text":"Loss Prevention"},{"text":"E-comme